Chat-turn rules
  1 Host input records flow/chat:host unless paste contains protocol/ocs (load).
  2 Slash commands map onto existing families only.
  3 While gated, KickGuard replies flow/chat:KickGuard + query/clarify:consent.
  4 Resume = load a protocol/ocs document without cmd/halt.
  5 Natural language may call GenAI; /halt and /mode stay local.
  6 GenAiClient is the only network path. Keys never enter this file.

